# Visual novel demo: the bad route's last scene. The bus driver is a Spine portrait
# (src/content/characters/driver): each pose is an animation, his mouth moves while he talks,
# he blinks by himself, and his hat is a part (a Spine skin).
title The driver

bg bus_inside
show driver at right
driver: Last stop. Everybody out.
driver:surprised: Oh! You're still here?
# A part: another skin on top. The pose keeps it until a pose sets its own (wave: the cap).
$ show('driver', { parts: { hat: 'party' } })
driver:happy: It's my last shift today. Like the hat?
driver:wave: Take care out there.
hide driver
